tates which flag gates which axis map, so 'a value referencing a capability-absent axis is rejected' is not executable without guessing the correspondence (e.g. status_map→has_transitions? link_map→has_link_types? create_defaults→? and hierarchy→has_hierarchy has no axis-map at all).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff65b17edd5865816","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 3 ('a value referencing a capability-absent axis is rejected') and step 4 (Capability descriptor)","norm_id":"n4a954e8d524a9c1b","priority":0.536,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor implementing validate() must decide which axis map each Capability flag gates; a wrong guess silently accepts or rejects the wrong axis"],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"Add a table to Approach step 4 mapping each axis to its gating flag, e.g. type_map→has_types, status_map→has_transitions, link_map→has_link_types, priority_map→has_priorities, hierarchy vocab→has_hierarchy, and specify whether create_defaults is gated (and by what).","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"